<title>JAPAN: Ono Sokki -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ono Sokki -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.74		vs	    7.58</p>
<p> Operating	  271    million	  vs	  213    million</p>
<p> Current	    276    million	  vs	  150    million</p>
<p> Net		  226    million	  vs	  108    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.50 yen	  vs	    3.60 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Ono Sokki Co Ltd is a manufacturer of digital measuring instruments.</p>
